ystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-f59ba8df)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Psychology</text>\n<text x=\"478.0\" y=\"220.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-f59ba8df)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Databases</text>\n<text x=\"226.8\" y=\"242.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-8a2de1d4)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Biology</text>\n<text x=\"315.2\" y=\"183.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-8a2de1d4)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Calculus</text>\n<text x=\"456.0\" y=\"299.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-f59ba8df)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Data Visualization</text>\n<text x=\"95.0\" y=\"385.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-f59ba8df)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Literature</text>\n<text x=\"256.4\" y=\"165.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.2\" fill=\"var(--ect-8a2de1d4)\" pointer-events=\"none\">Chemistry</text>\n</svg>\n<div id=\"ec-tooltip-1\" style=\"\n  display:none;position:absolute;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:6px;\n  font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;pointer-events:none;\n  background:var(--ect-57425a7e);color:var(--ect-21ade003);\n  box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);max-width:min(260px,100%);box-sizing:border-box;\n  z-index:999;line-height:1.4;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\n\"></div>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var tip=document.currentScript.parentElement.querySelector('#ec-tooltip-1');\n  var svg=document.currentScript.parentElement.querySelector('svg');\n  if(!svg||!tip) return;\n  // Next to the pointer but inside the plot (flipped to the pointer's left near the right edge),\n  // since anything past its edges is clipped, and scrolls, in a notebook or Quarto cell\n  function place(ev){\n    var r=svg.getBoundingClientRect();\n    var x=ev.clientX-r.left+12,y=ev.clientY-r.top-10;\n    if(x+tip.offsetWidth>r.width) x=ev.clientX-r.left-12-tip.offsetWidth;\n    tip.style.left=Math.max(0,Math.min(x,r.width-tip.offsetWidth))+'px';\n    tip.style.top=Math.max(0,Math.min(y,r.height-tip.offsetHeight))+'px';\n  }\n  function show(el,ev){\n    var raw=el.getAttribute('data-attrs');\n    if(!raw) return;\n    try{var d=JSON.parse(raw)}catch(e){return}\n    var h='';\n    for(var k in d){\n      var v=d[k];\n      if(Array.isArray(v)) v=v.join(', ');\n      h+='<div><b>'+k+'</b>: '+v+'</div>';\n    }\n    if(!h) return;\n    tip.innerHTML=h;tip.style.display='block';\n    place(ev);\n  }\n  svg.addEventListener('mouseover',function(ev){\n    var t=ev.target;\n    if(t.hasAttribute('data-node')||t.hasAttribute('data-edge')) show(t,ev);\n  });\n  svg.addEventListener('mousemove',function(ev){\n    if(tip.style.display==='block') place(ev);\n  });\n  svg.addEventListener('mouseout',function(ev){\n    var t=ev.target;\n    if(t.hasAttribute('data-node')||t.hasAttribute('data-edge'))\n      tip.style.display='none';\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</div></div>\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Ties\n\nWhen several cliques tie for the largest, one of them is returned. `towns()` holds 12\ntowns of a made-up county and the 26 roads between them. Two groups of four towns are all\njoined to one another by direct roads, and `maximum_clique()` returns the one with\nKestrel Bay:\n\n::: {#c650a49a .cell execution_count=4}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\ntowns = ec.towns()\nlabel = towns.get_label_from_id\n\n(\n    [label(n) for n in towns.maximum_clique()],\n    [[label(n) for n in c] for c in towns.find_cliques() if len(c) == 4],\n)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=4}\n```\n(['Greyford', 'Halston', 'Kestrel Bay', 'Larkhill'],\n [['Calder', 'Elmwick', 'Fenmoor', 'Greyford'],\n  ['Greyford', 'Halston', 'Kestrel Bay', 'Larkhill']])\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\n",
